    {
      "domain_name": "Catalog",
      "description": "This domain manages the product catalog that serves as the foundation for the ordering system. It is responsible for maintaining product definitions including SKU numbers, descriptions, pricing, inventory levels, and lead times. The Catalog domain supports operations such as creating, retrieving, updating, and deleting catalog items. It provides a central repository of available products that other domains (such as Quote) can reference when constructing product line items. The bounded context includes the presentation layer for catalog HTTP endpoints, business logic for catalog item validation, and data access layer for persisting and retrieving catalog items from the database."
